  "Full_Content": "<p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">General Studies (Paper - 1) 2017</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q1. How do you justify the view that the level of excellence of the Gupta</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">numismatic art is not at all noticeable in later times?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q2.Clarify how mid-eighteenth century India was beset with the spectre of</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">fragmented polity.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q3. Why did the 'Moderates' fail to carry conviction with the nation about</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">their proclaimed ideology and political goals by the end of the nineteenth</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">century ?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q4. What problems were germane to the decolonization process in the Malay</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Peninsula?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q5. How does the Juno Mission of NASA help to understand the origin and</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">evolution of the Earth?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q6. \"In spite of adverse environmental impact, coal mining is still inevitable for</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">development.\" Discuss.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">—</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q7. Mention the advantages of the cultivation of pulses because of which the year</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">2016 was declared as the International Year of Pulses by the United</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Nations.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q8. How does the cryosphere affect global climate ?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q9. In the context of the diversity of India, can it be said that the regions form cultural units rather than the States? Give reasons with examples for your view point.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q10. What are the two major legal initiatives by the State since Independence,</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">addressing discrimination against Scheduled Tribes (STs) ?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q11. The spirit of tolerance and love is not only an interesting feature of Indian</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">society from very early times, but it is also playing an important part at the</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">present. Elaborate.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q12. Examine how the decline of traditional artisanal industry in colonial India</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">crippled the rural economy.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q13. Highlight the importance of the new objectives that got added to the vision of</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Indian independence since the twenties of the last century.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q14. Account for variations in oceanic salinity and discuss its multi-dimensional</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">effects.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q15.Petroleum refineries are not necessarily located nearer to crude oil producing</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">areas, particularly in many of the developing countries. Explain its</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">implications.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q16. In what way can floods be converted into a sustainable source of irrigation and</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">all-weather inland navigation in India ?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q17. What characteristics can be assigned to monsoon climate that succeeds in</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">feeding more than 50 percent of the world population residing in Monsoon</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Asia?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q18. The women's questions arose in modern India as a part of the 19th century</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">social reform movement. What were the major issues and debates concerning</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">women in that period ?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q19. Distinguish between religiousness/religiosity and communalism giving one example of how the former has got transformed into the latter in independent India.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">—</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q20. \"The growth of cities as I.T. hubs has opened up new avenues of employment,</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">but has also created new problems.\" Substantiate this statement with</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">examples.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">👉 <strong>Click the link below to view/download the complete Question Paper.</strong> </p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1O0amoeeyIHCeNevFttQvgFqS9KyCg9IL/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#6C1D18] font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[#6C1D18]/40 hover:decoration-[#6C1D18] transition-colors\">General Studies - Paper 1</a></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div>",
